<title>USA: IPO FILING - Syntel Inc.</title>
<headline>IPO FILING - Syntel Inc.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name			Syntel Inc</p>
<p>Stock symbol			SYNT.O</p>
<p>Estimated price range	   $9-$11/shr</p>
<p>Total shares to be offered    3.0 million</p>
<p>Shrs offered by company	 3.0 million</p>
<p>Shrs outstanding after ipo    25.0 million</p>
<p>Lead Underwriter		 Hambrecht &amp; Quist</p>
<p>Underwriters over-allotment  450,000 shrs</p>
<p>Business: Troy, Mich., based company is a worldwide provider of information technology staffing and outsourcing services to Fortune 500 companies and government entities.</p>
<p>Use of Proceeds: for purchase of Syntel India, payment of undistributed S corp taxable income and general corporate purposes, including working capital and possible future acquisitions.</p>
<p>Financial Data in 000s year ended Dec 31:</p>
<p>				   1996		 1995</p>
<p>   - Revenue		 $92,237	    $90,326</p>
<p>   - Net Income	     $4,171	     $5,237</p>
